 "id": "f99b7b21-1f00-4b87-a62f-d7529d63a979",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "After Being Kicked Out of Adventurers' Party for Being So Called Useless, I Developed a Skill Called \"Weakness Spotting\""
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "役立たずと言われ勇者パーティを追放された俺、最強スキル《弱点看破》が覚醒しました"
   },
   {
    "en": "Yakudatazu to Iware Yuusha Party o Tsuihousareta Ore, Saikyou Skill \"Jakuten Kanpa\" ga Kakusei shimashita Tsuihoushatachi no Yose Atsume kara Hajimaru \"Tanoshii Haisha Fukkatsu Monogatari\""
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Wish, a young merchant who once played a crucial role in a battle against the Demon King's army, finds himself envied by the hero and kicked out of his party. Left with no choice, he sets out on a journey, only to find himself joined by a most unusual group:\n\nLilium, a former enemy and exiled demon lord officer; Milphina, a goddess banished from the heavens; and Noah, a Japanese reincarnate from another world who was summoned but soon cast aside.\n\nEach of them has a different origin, but they all share one thing in common: a past of being exiled. United by their shared experiences, the party of \"exiles\" is determined to make the most of their second chance at life as adventurers!\n\nThus begins their fun-filled comeback as they embark on a new chapter of their lives!"
  },
